OL,3,GNEWSAUniversities face 'substantial'
OL,4,Afunding cuts amid budget delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's universities are
OL,7,Ffacing a "substantial" cut of #21m in
OL,8,Fthe Stormont funding they receive to
OL,9,Fteach students.
OL,11,FThe top official at the Department for
OL,12,Fthe Economy (DfE), Ian Snowden, said
OL,13,Fthe universities were facing a
OL,14,Freduction of 6% on the opening funding
OL,15,Fthey received in 2024/25.
OL,17,FThe potential cuts come as the Northern
OL,18,FIreland Executive remains seven months
OL,19,Finto the financial year without a
OL,20,Fbudget.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
