OL,3,GNEWSAUniversities face 'substantial'
OL,4,Afunding cuts amid budget delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnowden said both Queen's University
OL,7,FBelfast (QUB) and Ulster University
OL,8,F(UU) are expected to have financial
OL,9,Fdeficits in 2025/26.
